hadiths[250]{hadithnumber,text}:
"250","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ali se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jald-baaz, [khabar] phailane wale, aur beej bone wale na bano; be-shak tumhare peeche sakht aur dard-naak aazmaish hai, aur bhaari lambe muamlat hain."""
"251","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Jubairah bin Dahhak se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamare bare mein Bani Salamah nazil hui {""Aur ek doosre ko bure alqaab se na pukaro""} [Hujurat: 11]; unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laye, aur hum mein se koi shakhs na tha magar uske do naam the. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate: ""Ae Falan!"" Toh woh kehte: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak woh us par ghadabnak hota hai."""
"252","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ikrimah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main nahin jaanta kis ne apne sathi ke liye khana banaya, Ibn Abbas ya unke chacha ke bete ne; jab baandi unke samne kaam kar rahi thi, toh un mein se ek ne use kaha: Ae zaniya! Toh un ne kaha: ""Khamosh! Agar duniya mein tum par hadd na lagayi gayi toh aakhirat mein lagayi jayegi."" Unhon ne kaha: Batao agar aisa ho? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Be-shak Allah fahhsh mutafahhish ko pasand nahin karta."" Ibn Abbas hi ne kaha: be-shak Allah fahhsh mutafahhish ko pasand nahin karta."
"253","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Bakrah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ka Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas zikr hua, phir ek shakhs ne uski khair samet tareef ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum par afsos! Tum ne apne sathi ki gardan kaat di"" Aap use baar baar kehte rahe ""agar tum mein se koi tareef karne wala ho toh use kehna chahiye: Main use aisa aur aisa samajhta hun agar woh use aisa dekhta ho aur uska hisab Allah par hai; Allah ke samne kisi ko paak na thehraye."""
"254","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko suna jo kisi ki tareef kar raha tha aur mubalagha kar raha tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum ne us shakhs ko halak kar diya ya uski peeth tod di."""
"255","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibrahim Taimi se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Umar ke paas baithe the, phir ek shakhs ne unke samne kisi ki tareef ki. Umar ne kaha: ""Tum ne us shakhs ko apahij kar diya; Allah tumhein apahij kare."""
"256","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Tareef zibah hai."" Muhammad ne kaha: Yani, jab woh use qabool kare."
"257","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bahtareen mard Abu Bakr hain; bahtareen mard Umar hain; bahtareen mard Abu Ubaidah hain; bahtareen mard Usaid bin Hudair hain; bahtareen mard Sabit bin Qais bin Shammas hain; bahtareen mard Muadh bin Amr bin al-Jamuh hain; bahtareen mard Muadh bin Jabal hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Aur badtareen mard falan hai, badtareen mard falan hai"" yahan tak ke saat ginaye."
"258","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Mimar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs khada hua ameeron mein se ek ameer ki tareef karne laga, phir Miqdad ne uske chehre par mitti daali aur kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke hum tareef karne walon ke chehron par mitti daalein."""
"259","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Ibn Umar ke paas kisi ki tareef kar raha tha, phir Ibn Umar ne uske munh ki taraf mitti daali aur kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum tareef karne walon ko dekho, unke chehron par mitti daalo."""
"260","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Mihjan Aslami se Raja ne kaha: Ek din main Mihjan ke sath aaya yahan tak ke hum Basra walon ki masjid pahunche; Buraidah masjid ke darwazon mein se ek darwaze par baitha tha; unhon ne kaha: Masjid mein ek shakhs tha jise Sakbah kaha jata tha jo namaz lambi karta tha. Jab hum masjid ke darwaze par pahunche aur woh burdah pehne tha aur Buraidah mazaq karne wala tha. Us ne kaha: ""Ae Mihjan! Kya tum namaz parhte ho jaise Sakbah namaz parhta hai?"" Mihjan ne use jawab nahin diya aur wapas hua. Mihjan ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda, hum chalte hue Uhud par chadhe; Aap ne Madina ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: ""Us [shehar] ki maa par afsos [chhode jane par]; uske rehne wale use chhod denge uske sab se aabad hone par; Dajjal uske paas aayega aur uske har darwaze par farishta payega, toh woh us mein dakhil nahin hoga."" Phir Aap utre yahan tak ke jab hum masjid mein the, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko namaz parhte, sajda aur ruku karte dekha. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se poocha: ""Yeh kaun hai?"" Main ne uski khub tareef ki: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Yeh falan hai, aur yeh."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ruko, use na sunao warna use halak kar doge."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Aap chalte hue yahan tak ke jab apne hujre ke paas hue, lekin Aap ne apne donon hath jhaade, phir farmaya: Tumhare deen mein se bahtareen sab se aasan hai; tumhare deen mein se bahtareen sab se aasan hai"" teen baar."
"261","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Muhammad [bin Sireen] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh kehte the: ""Apne dost ki izzat us se na karo jo us par bhaari ho."""
"262","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab aadmi apne bhai ki iyadat kare ya uski ziyarat kare, Allah us se farmata hai: Tu paak hua aur tera chalna paak hua; tu ne jannat mein ghar bana liya."""
"263","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Umm Darda se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Salman Madaain se Shaam tak paidal chal kar hamari ziyarat ko aaye, kisaa kapda aur chadhi hui sirwal pehne hue. Ibn Shauzab ne kaha: Salman kisaa kapda pehne dekhe gaye sir dhaka khula kaan yani woh parganda haal the. Un se kaha gaya: ""Tum ne apne nafs ko bura banaya!"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Be-shak khair aakhirat ki khair hai."""
"264","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar ke ek ghar walon ki ziyarat ki, phir unke paas khana khaya. Jab bahar nikle, Aap ne ghar ki ek jagah ka hukm diya, phir chaatai par pani chhidka gaya, Aap ne us par namaz parhi aur unke liye dua ki."
"265","[AI-translation] (Sahih maqtooan) Abu Khaldah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Karim Abu Umayyah Abu al-Aliya ke paas ooni kapde pehne aaye. Abu al-Aliya ne kaha: ""Yeh sirf rahibon ke kapde hain; be-shak musalman jab ek doosre ki ziyarat karte the, zeenat karte the."""
"266","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abdullah, Asma ke aazad-karda ghulam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Asma ne mere liye tayalisa ka jubba nikala jiska gireban dibaj resham se balisht bhar tha, aur uske donon shagaaf us se kinaray-daar the. Unhon ne kaha: ""Yeh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka jubba hai; Aap use wafd ke liye aur juma ke din pehente the."""
"267","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne istabraq ka hulla paya, phir use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laye aur kaha: ""Ise khareedo aur juma ke din ya jab wafd tumhare paas aayein pehno."" Aap alaihis salatu was salam ne farmaya: ""Be-shak use wahi pehenta hai jiska aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin."" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hulle diye gaye, phir Aap ne Umar ko ek hulla bheja, Usamah ko ek hulla, aur Ali ko ek hulla. Umar ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne use mere paas bheja, halanke Aap uske bare mein jo kehna tha keh chuke hain?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Becho, ya us se apni hajat poori karo."""
"268","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ek shakhs ne ek gaon mein apne bhai ki ziyarat ki, phir Allah ne uske raaste par farishta muqarrar kiya. Farishte ne poocha: Kahan chahte ho? Us ne jawab diya: Is gaon mein mera bhai hai. Farishte ne poocha: Kya uska tum par koi ehsan hai jise tum parwarish karte ho? Us ne jawab diya: Nahin. Main use Allah ke liye mehbub rakhta hun. Farishte ne kaha: Be-shak main tumhare paas Allah ka bheja hua hun: be-shak Allah tumhein mehbub rakhta hai jaise tum ne use mehbub rakha."""
"269","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Shakhs kisi qaum se muhabbat karta hai lekin unke amal tak nahin pahunch sakta?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum, ae Abu Dharr, uske sath ho jise tum mehbub rakhte ho."" Main ne kaha: ""Main Allah aur uske Rasool se muhabbat karta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum uske sath ho jise tum mehbub rakhte ho, ae Abu Dharr!"""
"270","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: ""Ae Nabiullah! Qiyamat kab hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum ne uske liye kya tayyar kiya?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Main ne uske liye zyada tayyar nahin kiya, siwa iske ke main Allah aur uske Rasool se muhabbat karta hun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Shakhs uske sath hai jise woh mehbub rakhta hai."" Anas ne kaha: Main ne musalmanon ko Islam ke baad us se zyada khush nahin dekha jitna woh us din khush hue."
"271","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo hamare chhote par reham na kare, aur hamare bade ka haq na pehchane, woh hum mein se nahin."""
"272","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte hain, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo hamare chhote par reham na kare, aur hamare [doosre lafz mein: izzat kare] bade ka haq na pehchane, woh hum mein se nahin."""
"273","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Umamah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo hamare chhote par reham na kare, aur hamare bade ki izzat na kare, woh hum mein se nahin."""
"274","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ashari [yani Abu Musa] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak Allah ki tazeem mein se hai safaid-baal musalman ki izzat, Quran ke hamil ki jo us mein ghulu na kare, aur na us se door ho, aur aadil hukmaran ki izzat."""
"275","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Rafe bin Khadij aur Sahl bin Abi Hasma se riwayat hai ke un donon ne bayan kiya ya use bayan kiya ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisah bin Masud Khaibar aaye, phir khajoor ke bagh mein juda hue; Abdullah bin Sahl qatl hue. Abdur Rahman bin Sahl aur Huwayysah aur Muhayyisah ibn Masud Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur apne sathi ke muamle mein baat ki. Abdur Rahman ne shuru kiya halanke woh qaum mein sab se chhota tha! Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use farmaya: ""Bade ko, bade ko"" Yahya ne kaha: bada baat kare phir unhon ne apne sathi ke muamle mein baat ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum apne maqtool ke [qisas ke] haqdar ho ya Aap ne kaha: apne sathi ke tum mein se pachas qasmon samet?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Muamla jo hum ne nahin dekha."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir Yahudi tum se pachas qasmon se baree honge?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kafir qaum!"" Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni taraf se uski diyat di. Sahl ne kaha: Main ne un oonton mein se ek oontni payi jo unke baade mein dakhil hui, phir us ne mujhe apne paon se thokar mari."
"276","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe us ped ke bare mein batao jiski misaal musalman jaisi hai: apne Rabb ke izn se har waqt apna phal deta hai, uske patte nahin jhadte."" Mere dil mein aaya: khajoor ka ped; lekin main baat karne se jhijhka, jabke wahan Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) the. Jab donon ne baat nahin ki, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Woh khajoor ka ped hai."" Jab main apne walid ke sath bahar nikla, main ne kaha: ""Ae mere abba! Mere dil mein aaya: khajoor ka ped."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhein use kehne se kis ne roka? Agar tum use kehte, woh mujhe is aur is se zyada mehbub hota."" Unhon ne kaha: Mujhe sirf is ne roka ke main ne Aapko aur Abu Bakr ko baat karte nahin dekha, toh main jhijhka."
"277","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Hakeem bin Qais bin Aasim se riwayat hai ke unke walid ne maut ke waqt apne beton ko wasiyat ki: ""Allah se daro aur apne bade ko sardar banao; be-shak jab koi qaum apne bade ko sardar banati hai, woh apne baap ke qaim-muqam hote hain; jab apne chhote ko sardar banati hai, woh unhein unke ham-saron mein zaleel karta hai. Tum par maal aur uska hasil karna lazim hai; be-shak woh kareem ko buland karta hai aur us se laeem se be-niyaz hua jata hai. Logon se mangne se bacho; be-shak woh shakhs ki badtareen kamayi hai. Jab main mar jaun, mujh par nauha na karna; be-shak Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nauha nahin kiya gaya. Jab main mar jaun, mujhe aisi zameen mein dafan karna jahan mere dafan ko Bani Bakr bin Waail na jane; be-shak main jahiliyat mein un par hamla karta tha."""
"278","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pakeeza phal diya jata, Aap farmate: ""Ae Allah! Hamare shehar, hamare mudd, aur hamare saa mein barkat de barkat par barkat."" Phir Aap use sab se chhote bachche ko dete jo Aapke paas hota."
"279","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Yaala bin Murrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle, hamein khane ki dawat di gayi; Husain raaste mein khel raha tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qaum se aage badhe, apne donon hath phailaye; Husain idhar aur udhar dauda; Aap use hansate rahe yahan tak ke pakad liya Aap ne ek hath uski thodhi par aur doosra uske sir par rakha phir use gale lagaya aur bosa diya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Husain mujh se hai aur main us se hun; Allah us se muhabbat kare jo Hasan aur Husain se muhabbat kare; donon [nabiyon ke] nawason mein se nawasay [sibtain] hain."""
"280","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Bukair se riwayat hai: ""Ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Jaafar ko Zainab bint Umar bin Abi Salamah ko bosa dete dekha, jab woh do saal ya us jaisi thi."""
"281","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Agar tum taqat rakho ke apne ghar walon mein se kisi ke baal na dekho siwa apni biwi ya chhote bachche ke toh karo."""
"282","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera naam Yusuf rakha, mujhe apni god mein bithaya, aur mere sir par hath phera."""
"283","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ladkiyon ki gudiyon se khelti thi; meri saheliyan mere sath khelti theen. Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andar tashreef late, woh Aap se chhup jatin, phir Aap unhein mere paas bhejte, aur woh mere sath khelteen."""
"284","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abu al-Ajlan Muharibi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Ibn Zubair ki fauj mein tha; mere chacha ke bete ka inteqal hua aur us ne Allah ke raaste mein ek oont ki wasiyat ki. Main ne uske bete se kaha: Oont mere hawale kar do; main Ibn Zubair ki fauj mein hun! Us ne kaha: Aao hum Ibn Umar ke paas chalein taake poochhein. Hum Ibn Umar ke paas aaye. Us ne kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Mere walid ka inteqal hua, aur unhon ne Allah ke raaste mein ek oont ki wasiyat ki. Aur yeh mere chacha ka beta hai woh Ibn Zubair ki fauj mein hai kya main use oont de dun? Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ae mere bete! Be-shak Allah ka raasta har naik amal hai; tumhare walid ne apne oont ki Allah Azza wa Jalla ke raaste mein wasiyat ki. Jab tum musalman qaum ko mushrik qaum se ladte dekho, oont unhein de do; be-shak yeh aur uske sathi [kisi] qaum ke khadimon ke raaste mein hain kaun mohar lagata hai [use apnane ke liye]!"""
"285","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jarir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo logon par reham nahin karta, Allah Azza wa Jalla us par reham nahin karta."""
"286","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Jo reham nahin karta, us par reham nahin kiya jata; jo muaf nahin karta, use muaf nahin kiya jata; jo darguzar nahin karta, use darguzar nahin kiya jata; [jo tauba nahin karta, uski tauba qabool nahin ki jati]; aur jo khud ko nahin bachata, use nahin bachaya jata."""
"287","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Qurrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak main bakri zibah karta hun phir us par reham karta hun"" ya unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main bakri par reham karta hun jise main zibah karunga."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Us bakri ki qasam, agar tum us par reham karoge, Allah tum par reham karega"" do baar."
"288","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Sadiq Masdooq Aba al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Rehmat bad-bakht ke siwa kisi se nahin chheeni jati."""
"289","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghar walon par sab logon se zyada raheem the; Aapka doodh-shareek beta Madina ke kinare tha, uski daya lohar thi; hum uske paas jate the ghar izkhir se dhuan-aloor tha phir Aap use bosa dete aur sunghte."""
"290","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chhote bachche samet aaya, phir woh use gale lagane laga. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum us par reham karte ho?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah tum par tum se zyada raheem hai jitne tum us par ho; woh sab se zyada raheem hai."""
"291","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab ek shakhs raaste mein chal raha tha aur use sakht pyas lagi, us ne kunwan paya phir us mein utra aur piya, phir bahar nikla; toh kutta zabaan nikale hue tha, pyas se mitti kha raha tha. Shakhs ne kaha: Is kutte ko pyas us jaisi pahunchi jaisi mujhe pahunchi thi. Woh kunwan mein utra, apne donon joote bhare, unhein apne munh se pakda, phir kutte ko pani pilaya. Allah ne uska shukr ada kiya aur use bakhsh diya."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya hamare liye janwaron mein ajr hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Har geeli kaleji wale mein ajr hai."""
"292","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek aurat ko billi ki wajah se azab hua: us ne use qaid kiya yahan tak ke woh bhook se mar gayi, phir us wajah se aag mein dakhil hui. Kaha gaya Allah behtar jaanta hai: Na tum ne use khilaya, na pilaya jab use qaid kiya, aur na use chhoda ke woh zameen ke keede khaye."""
"293","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Reham karo tum par reham kiya jayega; muaf karo Allah tumhein muaf karega. Afsos baat ke qeefon [jo sunte hain lekin amal nahin karte] par; afsos lagatar karne walon par jo lagatar karte hain jo unhon ne kiya halanke woh jaante hain."""
"294","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Umamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo reham kare agarche zabiha par, Allah qiyamat ke din us par reham karega."""
"295","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek jagah utre, phir ek shakhs ne humrah [chhoti chidiya] ke ande liye. Uski maa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sir par par phadphadane aayi. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kis ne use uske ande se ghabraya?"" Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main ne uska anda liya."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Wapas kar, us par reham karte hue."""
"296","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ibn Zubair Makkah mein the, jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba pinjron mein parinde liye hue the."""
"297","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke unki walida Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah bin Abi Muait ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jhoota woh nahin jo logon ke darmiyan sulah kare, phir khair kahe ya khair pahunchaye."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap ko rukhsat dete hue nahin suna logon ke jhoot mein se kisi mein siwa teen ke: logon ke darmiyan sulah, mard ki apni biwi se baat, aur aurat ki apne shohar se baat."
"298","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par sach lazim hai; be-shak sach neki ki taraf le jata hai, neki jannat ki taraf le jati hai. Shakhs hamesha sach bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas siddiq likha jata hai. Aur jhoot se bacho; be-shak jhoot fujoor ki taraf le jata hai, fujoor aag ki taraf le jata hai. Shakhs hamesha jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke paas kazzab likha jata hai."""
"299","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jhoot jaiz nahin, sanjeedgi mein na mazaq mein; aur tum mein se koi apne bete se wada kare phir use poora na kare."""
"300","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Momin jo logon se milta-julta hai aur unki takleef par sabr karta hai, us se bahtar hai jo logon se nahin milta-julta aur unki takleef par sabr nahin karta."""
"301","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi shakhs ya koi cheez nahin jo suni hui takleef par Allah Azza wa Jalla se zyada sabr karne wali ho; woh dawa karte hain ke Uska beta hai, lekin woh unhein aafiyat aur rizq deta hai."""
"302","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek taqseem taqseem ki jaise baaz jo Aap taqseem karte the phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Yeh aisi taqseem hai jis mein Allah Azza wa Jalla ka chehra nahin chaha gaya! Main ne kaha: Main zaroor Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kahunga, phir main Aapke paas aaya jab Aap apne sahaba mein the phir main ne Aap se sargoshi ki. Woh Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par bhaari hui; chehra badal gaya aur ghadabnak hue, yahan tak ke main ne chaha kaash main ne Aapko khabar na di hoti. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Musa ko is se zyada takleef di gayi phir sabr kiya."""
"303","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Darda se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein namaz, roza, aur sadqe se afzal darje ke bare mein na bataun?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Talluq sudharna; talluq bigadna mundne wali [deen] hai."""
"304","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se [Allah ke farman] ke bare mein: {""Phir Allah se daro aur apne darmiyan talluq sudharo""} [Anfal: 1]; unhon ne kaha: ""Yeh Allah ki taraf se momineen par takeed hai ke woh Allah se darein aur apne darmiyan talluq sudharein."""
"305","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Do khaslatein jinhein meri ummat nahin chhodti: nauha aur nasab mein taan."""
"306","[AI-translation] Auf bin al-Haris bin Tufail se jo Ayesha ke maa-sharik bhai ke bete the ke Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ko khabar di gayi ke Abdullah bin Zubair ne Ayesha ke diye hue ek sauday ya atiye ke bare mein kaha: ""Allah ki qasam, Ayesha zaroor rukegi, ya main use [uske maal se] rok dunga."" Ayesha ne kaha: ""Kya us ne yeh kaha?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Ayesha ne kaha: ""Woh Allah ke liye nazr hai ke main Ibn Zubair se kabhi baat nahin karungi."" Ibn Zubair ne Muhajireen se sifarish chahi jab Ayesha ka us se hijr [khamoshi] lamba hua. Ayesha ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam! Main us mein kabhi kisi ki sifarish nahin karungi, aur apni nazr jo main ne manni kabhi nahin todungi."" Jab Ibn Zubair par lamba hua, us ne Miswar bin Makhramah aur Abdur Rahman bin al-Aswad bin Abd Yaghuth se baat ki jo donon Bani Zuhrah se the. Us ne un donon se kaha: ""Main tumhein Allah ka wasta deta hun ke mujhe Ayesha ke paas dakhil karo; be-shak uske liye mera qata nazr karna jaiz nahin."" Miswar aur Abdur Rahman use apni dono chadaron mein lapet kar laye, yahan tak ke Ayesha se ijazat mangi. Donon ne kaha: ""Assalamu alaika wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, kya hum dakhil hon?"" Ayesha ne kaha: ""Dakhil ho."" Donon ne kaha: ""Hum sab, ae Ummul Momineen?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan, tum sab dakhil ho."" Ayesha nahin jaanti theen ke un donon ke sath Ibn Zubair hai. Jab woh dakhil hue, Ibn Zubair hijab mein dakhil hua, Ayesha se lipat gaya, aur rote hue use manane laga; Miswar aur Abdur Rahman Ayesha ko manate rahe ke woh us se baat kare aur use qabool kare. Donon ne kaha: ""Tum jaan chuki ho ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya jo tum hijr [boycott] ke bare mein jaan chuki ho; be-shak kisi ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada hijr kare."" Unhon ne kaha: Jab unhon ne yaad-dihani aur takeed zyada ki, Ayesha unhein yaad karne lageen aur rone lageen. Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne nazr mani, aur nazr bhaari hai."" Woh use dabate rahe yahan tak ke Ayesha ne Ibn Zubair se baat ki, phir unhon ne apni nazr mein chalees ghulam aazad kiye; chalees ghulam aazad karne ke baad, jab woh use yaad kartin, rotin yahan tak ke unke aansu unke khimar ko bhigo dete."
"307","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek doosre se bughz na rakho, hasad na karo, peeth na phero; Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano. Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada hijr kare."""
"308","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Ayyub, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada hijr kare: donon milte hain, yeh munh pherta hai aur woh munh pherta hai; un donon mein se bahtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare."""
"309","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ek doosre se bughz na rakho, muqabla na karo; Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano."""
"310","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Koi do ek doosre se Allah Jalla wa Azza ke liye ya Islam mein muhabbat nahin karte, phir unke darmiyan judayi ho, magar pehle gunah ki wajah se jo un mein se ek kare."""
"311","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Amir Ansari se jo Anas bin Malik ke chacha ke bete the; unke walid Uhud ke din qatl hue the ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh musalman se teen [din] se zyada talluq tode; donon haq se hate hue hain jab tak qata par qayam hon; jo pehle wapas aaye, uska wapas aana uske liye kaffara hoga jo pehal se wapas aaya; agar donon qata par marein, donon jannat mein kabhi sath dakhil nahin honge; agar woh use salam kahe lekin woh uska salam qabool karne se inkar kare, farishta use jawab dega aur shaitan doosre ko jawab dega."""
"312","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main tumhara gussa aur tumhari raza pehchanta hun."" Main ne kaha: ""Aap use kaise jaante hain, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum raazi hoti ho, kehti ho: Haan, Muhammad ke Rabb ki qasam; aur jab tum naraz hoti ho! Kehti ho: Nahin, Ibrahim ke Rabb ki qasam."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Haan! Main sirf tumhara naam hijr karti hun."""
"313","[AI-translation] Abu Khirash Sulami se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo apne bhai se saal bhar hijr kare, woh uska khoon bahane jaisa hai."" Doosri riwayat mein: Imran bin Abi Anas se, ke Aslam mein se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs ne unhein bayan kiya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, unhon ne kaha [phir us jaisa zikr kiya]. Majlis mein Muhammad bin al-Munkadir aur Abdullah bin Abi Attab the; donon ne kaha: ""Hum ne yeh un se suna hai."""
"314","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansari se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh apne bhai se teen din se zyada hijr kare: donon milte hain, yeh munh pherta hai aur woh munh pherta hai; un donon mein se bahtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare."""
"315","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ek doosre se bughz na rakho, hasad na karo; Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano."""
"316","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum qiyamat ke din Allah ke paas badtareen logon mein paoge: do chehron wala jo inke paas ek chehre se aata hai, aur unke paas [mukhtalif] chehre se."""
"317","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bad-gumani se bacho; be-shak bad-gumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Najash [jaali boli] na karo, hasad na karo, bughz na rakho, muqabla na karo, peeth na phero; Allah ke bande bhai bhai bano."""
"318","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jannat ke darwaze Peer aur Jumairat ko khole jate hain; har bande ko jo Allah ke sath kisi ko shareek nahin karta bakhsh diya jata hai, siwa us shakhs ke jis ke aur uske bhai ke darmiyan dushmani ho. Kaha jata hai: In donon ko multawi karo yahan tak ke sulah karein."""
"319","[AI-translation] Abu Darda se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Kya main tumhein woh na bataun jo tumhare liye sadqe aur roze se bahtar hai? Talluq sudharna. Khabardar, bughz mundne wali [deen] hai."""
"320","[AI-translation] Wahb bin Kaisan se jo Wahb ne Abdullah bin Umar ko paya unhon ne kaha: ""Umar ne ek charwahe ko buri jagah mein dekha aur us se bahtar jagah dekhi; unhon ne use kaha: Tujh par afsos, ae charwahe! Use muntaqil kar; be-shak main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Har charwaha apne rewad ke bare mein poocha jayega."""
"321","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Hamare liye buri misaal nahin: apne atiye par wapas aane wala, jaise kutta apni qai par wapas aata hai."""
"322","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Momin seedha aur kareem hai; jabke fajir chalak aur laeem hai."""
"323","[AI-translation] Umm Darda [yani chhoti, faqeeha] se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs unke paas aaya aur bola: ""Be-shak ek shakhs ne Abdul Malik ke paas tumhari burayi ki."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Agar hum par woh tohmat lagayi jaye jo hum mein nahin, humari aksar us se tareef ki gayi jo hum mein nahin."""
"324","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai: ""Jab shakhs apne dost se kahe: Tum mere dushman ho, un mein se ek Islam se nikal gaya, ya apne dost se baree hua."""
"325","[AI-translation] Lais se, Taus se, Ibn Abbas se main samajhta hun unhon ne use marfu kiya, Lais ne shak kiya unhon ne kaha: ""Bani Aadam mein teen sau saath jod ya haddi, ya mafsil hain har ek par har din sadqa hai: har achhi baat sadqa hai; shakhs ka apne bhai ki madad sadqa hai; pani ka ghoont jo woh pilaye sadqa hai; aur raaste se takleef hatana sadqa hai."""
"326","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Do ek doosre ko bura kehne wale jo donon kahein pehal karne wale par hai, jab tak mazloom had se na badhe."""
"327","[AI-translation] Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Do ek doosre ko bura kehne wale jo donon kahein pehal karne wale par hai, yahan tak ke mazloom had se badhe."""
"328","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho adhah kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Allah aur uske Rasool zyada jaante hain."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Baat ko baaz logon se baaz tak muntaqil karna; taake unke darmiyan fasad karein."""
"329","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla ne meri taraf wahi ki ke tum aajzi karo aur tum mein se baaz baaz par zulm na karein."""
"330","[AI-translation] Iyadh bin Himar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki ke tum aajzi karo yahan tak ke koi ek doosre par zulm na kare aur koi ek doosre par fakhr na kare."" Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Batao agar koi shakhs mujhe majme mein bura kahe woh mujh se kamtar hain, phir main ne use jawab diya; kya mujh par us mein gunah hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Do ek doosre ko bura kehne wale do shaitan hain jo ek doosre ko bura kehte aur ek doosre ko jhutlate hain."""
"331","[AI-translation] Iyadh ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se lad raha tha, phir main ne Aap ko oontni hadiya di apne Islam lane se pehle; Aap ne use qabool nahin kiya aur farmaya: ""Be-shak main mushrikeen ke atiye ko na-pasand karta hun."""
"332","[AI-translation] Saad bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Musalman ko bura kehna fisq hai."""
"333","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) fahhsh, lanat karne wale, aur bura kehne wale na the; jab sargoshi karte, Aap farmate: ""Use kya hua? Uski peshani khaak-aalood ho [woh kamyab ho]."""
"334","[AI-translation] Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Musalman ko bura kehna fisq hai, aur us se ladna kufr hai."""
"335","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Koi shakhs doosre par fisq ki tohmat nahin lagata aur na us par kufr ki tohmat lagata hai, magar donon us par wapas aate hain agar uska sathi waisa na ho."""
"336","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo apne baap ke siwa kisi ki taraf nisbat kare halanke woh jaanta ho, us ne kufr kiya; jo kisi qaum ki taraf nisbat kare halanke woh un mein se na ho, use chahiye ke aag mein apni jagah bana le; jo kisi ko kufr samet pukare ya kahe: Allah ke dushman, halanke waisa nahin hai, magar donon us par wapas aate hain."""
"337","[AI-translation] Adi bin Sabit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sulaiman bin Surad ko suna Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs se kehte hue do shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek doosre ko bura keh rahe the; un mein se ek ghadabnak hua yahan tak ke chehra phool gaya aur badal gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main ek kalima jaanta hun agar woh use kahe, jo woh pata hai us se door ho jaye."" Ek shakhs uske paas gaya aur use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka qoul bataya, aur kaha: [Be-shak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:] ""Allah se mardood shaitan ki panah mango."" Us ne kaha: ""Kya tum mujh mein beemari dekhte ho?! Kya main majnoon hun?! Jao!"""
"338","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kuchh kiya phir us mein rukhsat di; baaz qaum us se door rahi. Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchi; Aap ne khutba diya, Allah ki hamd ki, phir farmaya: ""Qaumon ka kya haal hai jo us se door rehte hain jo main karta hun? Allah ki qasam! Be-shak main un mein Allah ke bare mein sab se zyada janne wala aur us se sab se zyada darne wala hun."""
"339","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe aur Zubair bin al-Awwam ko bheja donon sawar the. Nabi [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ne farmaya: ""Jao yahan tak ke falan falan bagh tak pahunch jao; wahan tumhein ek aurat milegi; uske paas ek khat hai jo Hatib ne mushrikeen ko likha hai. Woh khat mere paas le aao."" Hum ne us aurat ko apne oont par jate hue usi jagah pa liya jahan Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamare liye nishan-dahi ki thi. Toh hum ne [us aurat se] kaha: Woh khat kahan hai jo tumhare paas hai? Us ne kaha: Mere paas koi khat nahin hai. Toh hum ne uski aur uske oont ki talashi li. Mere sathi ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke uske paas nahin hai. Main ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jiske qabze mein meri jaan hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kabhi ghalat nahin farmaya hai. Are aurat, ya toh khat nikal warna main tujhe be-libas kardunga. Toh woh apne hath ko apni kamar se neeche le gayi. Woh ooni tehband bandhe hue thi. Us mein se us ne khat nikala, hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein [khat le] aaye. Is par Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Is shakhs [Hatib] ne Allah, uske Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur sare musalmanon se khayanat ki, mujhe ijazat dein ke main uski gardan uda dun. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [Hatib se] farmaya: ""Tumhein kis baat ne is par aamada kiya?"" Unhon"
"340","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo bhi apne bhai se kahe: Kafir, un mein se ek par zaroor wapas aata hai."""
"341","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab koi doosre se kahe: Kafir, toh un mein se ek ne kufr kiya: agar jise us ne kaha kafir hai, woh sachcha hai; aur agar waisa nahin hai jaisa us ne use kaha, toh kehne wala kufr samet wapas aaya."""
"342","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bure faisle aur dushman ki [museebat par] khushi se panah mangte the."
"343","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah tumhare liye teen baton se raazi hai aur teen baton se naraz hai: woh tumhare liye raazi hai ke tum Uski ibadat karo aur uske sath kisi ko shareek na karo; tum sab Allah ki rassi ko mazboot pakdo; aur tum uske sath khair-khwahi karo jise Allah ne tumhare muamle ka zimmedar banaya. Woh tumhare liye na-pasand karta hai: qeel-o-qaal, zyada sawal, aur maal zaya karna."""
"344","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se Allah Azza wa Jalla ke farman ke bare mein: {""Aur jo tum kharch karo toh woh use badal dega, aur woh sab se bahtar rizq dene wala hai""} [Saba: 39]; unhon ne kaha: ""Baghair israaf, aur baghair kanjoosi."""
"345","[AI-translation] Abu al-Ubaidain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se israaf karne walon ke bare mein poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh jo na-haq mein kharch karte hain."""
"346","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se [lafz] ke bare mein: {""israaf karne wale""}; unhon ne kaha: ""Na-haq mein israaf karne wale."""
"347","[AI-translation] Aslam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar mimbar par kehte the: ""Ae logon! Apne thikanon ko durust karo aur in saanpon se daro is se pehle ke woh tumhein darayein; be-shak unke musalman tumhein nazar nahin aayenge. Allah ki qasam, hum ne un se kabhi sulah nahin ki jab se hum ne un se dushmani ki."""
"348","[AI-translation] Khabbab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak shakhs har cheez mein ajr diya jata hai, siwa tameer [fuzool] ke."""
"349","[AI-translation] Nafe bin Aasim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr ko apne bhatije se kehte hue suna jo Wahat se bahar nikla tha: ""Kya tumhare mazdoor kaam karte hain?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Main nahin jaanta!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Agar tum Saqifi hote, toh tum jaante tumhare mazdoor kya kaam karte hain."" Phir woh hamari taraf mutawajjuh hue aur kaha: ""Be-shak jab shakhs apne mazdooron ke sath apne ghar mein kaam kare"" Abu Aasim ne ek baar kaha: ""apne maal par"" ""woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ke mazdooron mein se mazdoor hai."""
"350","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qayam nahin hogi yahan tak ke log imaratein buland karne mein muqabla karein."""
"351","[AI-translation] Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Usman bin Affan ki khilafat mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyon ke gharon mein dakhil hua; main apne hath se unki chhaton ko chhuta tha [unki pasti ki wajah se]."""
"352","[AI-translation] Dawood bin Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne [Nabi ki biwiyon ke] hujre khajoor ki shaakhon se dekhe, bahar se oon ke kapde se dhake hue; main samajhta hun ghar ki chaudayi hujre ke darwaze se ghar ke darwaze tak chhe ya saat haath thi; main andar ke ghar ka andaza das haath lagata hun; aur main samajhta hun uski motayi aath aur saat [haath] ke darmiyan thi, us jaisi. Main Ayesha ke darwaze par khada hua, toh woh maghrib ki taraf tha."""
"353","[AI-translation] Qais bin Abu Hazim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Khabbab ke paas iyadat ko dakhil hue jab use saat daagh lagaye gaye the. Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak hamare sathi jo guzar gaye chale gaye, aur duniya ne unhein kam nahin kiya; jabke hamein [maal] mila jiski hamein mitti ke siwa jagah nahin milti. Agar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein maut ki dua se mana na kiya hota, toh main us se dua karta."""
"354","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya jab main apni jhopdi durust kar raha tha: ""Yeh kya hai?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Main apni jhopdi durust karta hun, Ya Rasoolullah!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Muamla [qiyamat/maut] is se tez hai."""
"355","[AI-translation] Nafe bin Abd al-Haris se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Shakhs ki saadat mein se hain: kushaada makan, naik padosi, aur aaram-deh sawari."""
"356","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat qayam nahin hogi yahan tak ke log ghar banayein jinhein woh marahil [dhari-daar kapdon] jaisa banayein."" Ibrahim ne kaha: Yani dhari-daar kapde."
"357","[AI-translation] Warrad Mughirah ke katib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ne Mughirah ko likha: ""Mujhe woh likho jo tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."" Us ne unhein likha: Be-shak Nabi Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har namaz ke baad kehte the: ""Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin akela, uska koi shareek nahin; usi ki badshahat aur hamd hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Ae Allah! Jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, jo Tu roke use koi dene wala nahin, aur maal-dar ko Tujh se uska maal nafa nahin deta."" Us ne unhein likha: ""Aap mana karte the qeel-o-qaal, zyada sawal, aur maal zaya karne se. Aap mana karte the maaon ki nafarmani, betiyon ko zinda dafan karne, [haq] rokne aur mangne se."""
"358","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kisi ko uska amal najat nahin dega."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Aapko bhi nahin, Ya Rasoolullah!"" Nabi [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ne farmaya: ""Mujhe bhi nahin, siwa iske ke Allah mujhe apni taraf se rehmat mein dhanp le. Toh seedhe raho, qareeb raho, subah chalo, shaam chalo, raat ke safar se thoda; aur darmiyana-ravi, darmiyana-ravi tum pahunchoge."""
"359","[AI-translation] Ayesha zawja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahudiyon ka ek giroh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua aur bola: ""As-sam alaikum [tum par maut]."" Ayesha ne kaha: Main ne samjha aur kaha: ""Alaikumus sam wallanah [maut aur lanat tum par]."" Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tehro, ae Ayesha! Be-shak Allah har muamle mein narmi pasand karta hai."" Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya Aap ne nahin suna unhon ne kya kaha?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main ne kaha: Wa alaikum."""
"360","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jise narmi nahin di gayi, use khair nahin di gayi."""
"361","[AI-translation] Abu Darda se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jise narmi mein se uska hissa diya gaya, use khair mein se uska hissa diya gaya; jise narmi mein se uska hissa nahin diya gaya, use khair mein se uska hissa nahin diya gaya. Qiyamat ke din momin ke meezan mein sab se bhaari cheez husn-e-akhlaq hai; be-shak Allah fahhsh aur gandi [zabaan wale] se bughz rakhta hai."""
"362","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Izzat walon ki laghzishon se darguzar karo."""
"363","[AI-translation] Anas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sakhti kisi cheez mein nahin hoti magar use bura karti hai; be-shak Allah narm hai aur narmi pasand karta hai."""
"364","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kunwari ladki se apne parda-nasheen hone mein zyada haya wale the; jab Aap kuchh na-pasand karte, hum Aapke chehre se jaan lete."""
"365","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main mushkil oontni par thi; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum par narmi lazim hai; be-shak narmi kisi cheez mein nahin hoti magar use khubsurat karti hai, aur kisi cheez se nahin nikali jati magar use bura karti hai."""
"366","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bukhl se bacho; be-shak us ne tum se pehlon ko halak kiya: unhon ne apne khoon bahaye, apne rishte tode; aur zulm qiyamat ke din andhera hai. [Fahash se bacho; be-shak Allah fahhsh mutafahhish ko pasand nahin karta.]"""
"367","[AI-translation] Kaseer bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ayesha Ummul Momineen (raziyallahu anha) ke paas dakhil hua. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ruko yahan tak ke main apne kapde ka phata si lun."" Main ne roka, phir kaha: ""Ae Ummul Momineen! Agar tum bahar niklo aur unhein batao, toh woh use tumhari taraf se bukhl ginege!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Apna muamla dekh; be-shak uske liye naya nahin jo purana nahin pehenta."""
"368","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah narm hai, narmi pasand karta hai, aur us par woh deta hai jo sakhti par nahin deta."""
"369","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Aasan karo, mushkil na karo; sukoon do, na bhagao."""
"370","[AI-translation] Haris [yani Ibn Laqit] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum mein se ek shakhs jiski ghodi bachcha janti, woh use zibah karta aur kehta: ""Kya main jeeta rahunga yahan tak ke is par sawar hun?!"" Phir hamare paas Umar ka khat aaya: ""Jo Allah ne tumhein rizq diya use durust karo; be-shak muamle mein kushaadgi hai."""
"371","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar qiyamat qayam ho aur tum mein se ek ke hath mein khajoor ka paudha ho; agar woh taqat rakhe ke woh qayam na ho yahan tak ke use lagaye, toh use lagaye."""
"372","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Teen duayein qabool ki jati hain: mazloom ki dua, musafir ki dua, aur walid ki apne bete par dua."""
"373","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Zulm se daro; be-shak zulm qiyamat ke din andhera hai. Bukhl se daro; be-shak bukhl ne tum se pehlon ko halak kiya aur unhein apne khoon bahane aur apni hurmaton ko halal karne par ubhara."""
"374","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Zulm qiyamat ke din andhera hai."""
"375","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab momineen aag se nijat payenge, unhein jannat aur aag ke darmiyan pul par roka jayega; woh duniya mein apne darmiyan mazalim ka qisas lenge, yahan tak ke jab saaf aur paak ho jayenge, unhein jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat di jayegi. Qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Be-shak un mein se ek apne makan [jannat mein] ka raasta duniya mein apne raaste se zyada janne wala hoga."""
"376","[AI-translation] Abu ad-Dhuha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Masrooq aur Shutair bin Shakl masjid mein jama hue; masjid ke halqay un donon ki taraf jhuk gaye. Masrooq ne kaha: ""Main unhein hamari taraf jama nahin dekhta magar hum se khair sunne ke liye. Tum Abdullah se bayan karo phir main tumhari tasdeeq karunga, ya main Abdullah se bayan karun phir tum meri tasdeeq karoge?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Bayan karo, ae Abu Ayesha!"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Donon aankhein zina karti hain, donon hath zina karte hain, donon paon zina karte hain, aur sharmgah sab ki tasdeeq karti hai ya jhutlati hai!?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne bhi suna."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Quran mein koi aayat halal, haram, hukm, aur nahi ko is aayat se zyada jama karne wali nahin: {Be-shak Allah adl, ehsan, aur rishtedar ko dene ka hukm deta hai}?"" [Nahl: 90] Us ne jawab diya: ""Haan, aur main ne bhi suna."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Quran mein koi aayat Uske farman se zyada jald faraaj wali nahin: {Jo Allah se dare, Woh uske liye raasta banata hai}?"" [Talaq: 2] Us ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne bhi suna."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Quran mein koi aayat Uske farman se zyada bada supurd karne wali nahin: {Ae mere bandon jinhon ne apni janon par zyadti ki, Allah ki rehmat se mayus na ho}?"" [Zumar: 53] Us ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne bhi suna."""
"377","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Allah Tabaraka wa Taala se, Us ne farmaya: ""Ae mere bandon! Be-shak Main ne zulm ko apne nafs par haram kiya aur use tumhare darmiyan haram banaya, toh ek doosre par zulm na karo. Ae mere bandon! Be-shak tumhi ho jo raat aur din khata karte ho, aur Main gunah bakhshta hun baghair parwah; toh Mujh se bakhshish mango, Main tumhein bakhsh dunga. Ae mere bandon! Tum sab bhooke ho siwa jise Main khilata hun; toh Mujh se khana mango, Main tumhein khilaunga. [Ae mere bandon!] Tum sab nange ho siwa jise Main pehnata hun; toh Mujh se kapda mango, Main tumhein pehnaunga. Ae mere bandon! Agar tum mein se pehle aur aakhir, tumhare insan aur jinn, tum mein se sab se muttaqi bande ke dil par hon, woh meri badshahat mein kuchh nahin badhayega; aur agar woh sab se fajir mard ke dil par hon, woh meri badshahat mein kuchh nahin ghatayega. Agar woh ek maidan mein jama hon phir Mujh se mangein aur Main un mein se har insan ko woh dun jo us ne manga; woh meri badshahat mein kuchh nahin ghatayega siwa jaise samandar ghat-ta hai ke us mein sui ek baar duboyi jaye. Ae mere bandon! Be-shak woh sirf tumhare aamal hain jo Main tum par muqarrar karta hun; jo khair paye, use Allah ki hamd karni chahiye; jo uske siwa paye, use sirf apne nafs ko malamat karni chahiye."" Abu Idris jab is hadees ko bayan karte, apne donon ghutnon par baith jate."
"378","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri aur Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Musalman ko thakan, beemari, fikr, ghum, takleef, aur bechaini jo bhi pahunche hatta ke kaanta jo use lage magar Allah us se uske gunahon mein se baaz ko mita deta hai."""
"379","[AI-translation] Saeed se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Salman ke sath tha unhon ne Kindah mein beemar ki iyadat ki jab andar dakhil hue, unhon ne kaha: ""Khush raho; be-shak momin ki beemari, Allah use uske liye kaffara aur wapsi ka mauqa banata hai; jabke fajir ki beemari oont ki tarah hai jise uske malik ne bandha phir chhoda woh nahin jaanta kyun bandha aur kyun chhoda."""
"380","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Aazmaish momin mard aur aurat par hamesha rehti hai apne badan, ghar walon, aur maal mein yahan tak ke woh Allah se mile baghair gunah."""
"381","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati aaya; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya Umm Mildam tumhein lagi?"" Us ne poocha: ""Umm Mildam kya hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Khall aur gosht ke darmiyan garmi."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tumhein dard-e-sar hua?"" Us ne poocha: ""Dard-e-sar kya hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Hawa jo sir mein phirti hai, ragon ko marti hai."" Us ne jawab diya: ""Nahin."" Jab woh khada hua, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo dozakhiyon mein se mard ko dekhna chahe, toh use dekhe."""
"382","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab momin shikayat [beemari] kare, Allah use paak karta hai jaise lohar ki dhonkani lohe ke zang ko paak karti hai."""
"383","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi musalman nahin jise museebat pahunche dard ya beemari magar woh uske gunahon ka kaffara hoti hai; hatta ke kaanta jo use lage, ya [chhoti] museebat."""
"384","[AI-translation] Ayesha bint Saad se riwayat hai ke unke walid ne kaha: Main sakht beemari mein mubtela hua; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri iyadat ko tashreef laye. Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main maal chhodta hun; main ek beti ke siwa kuchh nahin chhodta. Kya main apne maal ke do tihaayi ki wasiyat karun aur tihaayi chhodun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Nisf ki wasiyat karun, aur uske liye nisf chhodun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tihaayi ki wasiyat karun, aur uske liye do tihaayi chhodun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tihaayi; aur tihaayi bahut hai."" Phir Aap ne apna hath meri peshani par rakha, phir mera chehra aur pait sehla, phir farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Saad ko shifa de, aur uski hijrat poori kar."" Main hamesha Aapke hath ki thandak apne dil mein mehsoos karta tha mere khayal mein ab tak."
"385","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi shakhs beemar nahin hota, magar uske liye waisa likha jata hai jo woh sehat mein karta tha."""
"386","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Koi musalman nahin jise Allah uske badan mein aazmaye, magar uske liye woh likha jata hai jo woh apni sehat mein karta tha, jab tak woh beemar hai. Agar Woh use shifa de main samajhta hun unhon ne kaha Use paak karta hai; agar Woh use wafat de, Use bakhshta hai [doosri riwayat mein: agar Woh use shifa de, Use paak karta hai]."""
"387","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bukhar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [Sallallahu alaihi wasallam] ke paas aaya, phir bola: ""Mujhe apne ghar walon mein sab se mehbub ke paas bhej."" Aap ne use Ansar ke paas bheja; woh un par chhe din aur unki raaton raha. Woh un par bhaari hua; Aap unke paas unke gharon mein aaye; unhon ne Aap se shikayat ki. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghar ghar, kamra kamra dakhil hue, unke liye aafiyat ki dua karte hue. Jab wapas hue, un mein se ek aurat Aapke peeche aayi aur boli: ""Qasam us zaat ki jis ne Aapko haq ke sath bheja, main Ansar mein se hun, aur mere walid Ansar mein se hain; mere liye dua karein jaise Aap ne Ansar ke liye dua ki."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhari marzi: agar chaho, main dua karun ke Allah tumhein shifa de; agar chaho, tum sabr karo aur tumhare liye jannat hai."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main sabr karungi, aur jannat ko daon [khatre mein dali] par nahin lagaungi."""
"388","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Koi beemari jo mujhe lagti hai, bukhar se zyada mehbub nahin; kyunke woh mere har uzw mein dakhil hoti hai, aur be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla har uzw ko uske ajr ka hissa deta hai."""
"389","[AI-translation] Abu Nuhailah se riwayat hai: un se kaha gaya: ""Allah se dua karo."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Beemari kam kar, ajr kam na kar."" Un se kaha gaya: ""Dua karo, dua karo."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe muqarrabeen mein se bana; meri maa ko hooron mein se bana."""
"390","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne mujh se kaha: ""Kya main tumhein jannatiyon mein se aurat na dikhaun?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Yeh kaali aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur boli: Mujhe mirgi aati hai aur mera satr khul jata hai; mere liye dua karein. Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho, tum sabr karo aur tumhare liye jannat hai; agar chaho, main dua karun ke Allah tumhein shifa de. Unhon ne kaha: Main sabr karungi. Unhon ne kaha: Mera satr khul jata hai; dua karein ke mera satr na khule. Aap ne unke liye dua ki."""
"391","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai: ""Ke unhon ne Umm Zufar woh aurat lambi kaali Kaaba ki seedhi par dekhi."" Qasim se riwayat hai ke Ayesha ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: ""Momin ko jo bhi lage us se oopar, woh kaffara hai."""
"392","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Koi musalman nahin jise duniya mein kaanta lage aur woh us par ajr ki umeed rakhe, magar us se uske gunahon mein se qiyamat ke din kaata [mitaya] jayega."""
"393","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Koi momin mard aur aurat, musalman mard aur aurat, jo beemar ho magar Allah us se uske gunahon mein se kaat deta hai."""
"394","[AI-translation] Hisham se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Zubair ke sath Asma ke paas dakhil hua Abdullah ke qatl se das raatein pehle jab Asma beemar theen. Abdullah ne un se kaha: ""Tumhara kya haal hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Beemar."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main maut ke samne hun."" Asma ne kaha: ""Shayad tum meri maut chahte ho, is liye uski tamanna karte ho? Aisa na karo, Allah ki qasam main marna nahin chahti yahan tak ke tumhare do kinaron mein se ek par aaye, ya tum qatl ho jao phir main tum par ajr ki umeed rakhun, ya tum ghalib aao phir meri aankh thandi ho. Khabardar, tum par koi tadbeer pesh ki jaye, phir woh tumhein mawafiq na aaye, toh use maut ke khauf se qabool karo."" Ibn Zubair hi murad the: woh qatl honge toh use ghum hoga."
"395","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai ke woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hue jab Aap bukhar mein the, Aap par qatifa chadar thi. Unhon ne Aap par hath rakha aur uski garmi chadar ke oopar se mehsoos ki. Abu Saeed ne kaha: ""Tumhara bukhar kitna sakht hai Ya Rasoolullah!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Hum aise hi hain, hum par aazmaish sakht hoti hai, aur hamare liye ajr dogna hota hai."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Logon mein sab se sakht aazmaish wala kaun hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nabi, phir saliheen. Un mein se ek faqr se aazmaya jata tha, yahan tak ke use abaa ke siwa kuchh na milta jise woh phaad kar pehenta, aur joon se aazmaya jata yahan tak ke use maar deti, aur un mein se ek aazmaish se tum mein se ek ke atiye se zyada khush hota tha."""
"396","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main beemar hua; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) meri iyadat ko tashreef laye Abu Bakr samet donon paidal unhon ne mujhe behosh paya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya phir apne wuzu ka pani mujh par dala; main hosh mein aaya, toh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) the. Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main apne maal mein kya karun? [Kaise] apne maal mein faisla karun?"" Aap ne mujhe kuchh jawab nahin diya yahan tak ke meeras ki aayat nazil hui."
"397","[AI-translation] Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ka chhota bachcha sakraat mein tha; uski maa ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bheja: ""Mera beta maut ke samne hai."" Aap ne qasid se kaha: ""Jao phir un se kaho: Be-shak Allah ka hai jo Us ne liya, aur Uska hai jo Us ne diya; har cheez Uske paas muqarrar waqt tak hai; use sabr karna chahiye aur ajr ki umeed rakhni chahiye."" Qasid wapas gaya aur unhein khabar di; unhon ne Aapke paas qasam de kar bheja ke Aap zaroor aayein. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne chand sahaba samet khade hue, un mein se Saad bin Ubadah the. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use liya aur use apni donon pasliyon [seene] ke darmiyan rakha; uske seene se khushk mashkize jaisi aawaz nikli. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki donon aankhein aansu bahaane lageen. Saad ne kaha: ""Tum rote ho, halanke tum Rasoolullah ho!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Main us par reham karte hue rota hun; be-shak Allah apne bandon mein se sirf raheem par reham karta hai."""
"398","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abi Ablah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri biwi beemar thi; main Umm Darda ke paas jata tha. Woh mujh se kehtin: ""Tumhare ghar wale kaise hain?"" Main unhein kehta: ""Beemar hain,"" phir woh mere liye khane ki dua kartin, main khata. Phir main wapas aaya. Aisa kiya, phir main ek baar unke paas aaya, unhon ne poocha: ""Kaise?"" Main ne kaha: ""Woh theek ho gaye."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Main tumhare liye khane ki dua karti thi kyunke tum hamein apne ghar walon ke beemar hone ki khabar dete the; jahan tak ke woh theek ho gaye; hum tumhare liye kuchh dua nahin karte."""
"399","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek dehati ke paas iyadat ko dakhil hue. [Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab beemar ki iyadat ko dakhil hote] farmate: ""Tum par koi harj nahin; paak [gunahon se], Insha Allah."" Dehati ne kaha: [Woh paaki?! Hargiz nahin;] ""Balke tez bukhar budhe par, taake use qabron tak pahunchaye!"" Unhon [Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)] ne farmaya: ""Phir haan."""
"400","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kaun aaj subah rozedar hai?"" Abu Bakr ne jawab diya: ""Main."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kis ne aaj beemar ki iyadat ki"" Abu Bakr ne jawab diya: ""Main."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se kis ne aaj janaza dekha."" Abu Bakr ne jawab diya: ""Main."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kis ne aaj miskeen ko khilaya?"" Abu Bakr ne jawab diya: ""Main."" Marwan ne kaha: Mujhe pahunchi ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Yeh khaslatein ek din mein kisi mard mein jama nahin hotin, magar woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."""
"401","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umm as-Sayib ke paas dakhil hue jab woh kaanp rahi theen. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhein kya hua?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Bukhar Allah use zaleel kare."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ruko, use bura na kaho; be-shak woh momin ke gunah mita deta hai, jaise lohar ki dhonkani lohe ke zang ko mita deti hai."""
"402","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah farmata hai: Main ne tum se khana manga tum ne mujhe nahin khilaya. Woh kehta hai: Ae mere Rabb! Main Tujh se khana kaise mangu jabke main Tujhe nahin khilata, halanke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Allah farmata hai: Kya tum nahin jaante ke mere falan bande ne tum se khana manga tum ne use nahin khilaya? Kya tum nahin jaante ke agar tum use khilate, tum use mere paas pate? Ae Aadam ki aulaad! Main ne tum se pani manga tum ne mujhe nahin pilaya. Woh kehta hai: Ae mere Rabb! Main Tujhe kaise pilaun, halanke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Woh farmata hai: [Be-shak mere falan bande ne tum se pani manga tum ne use nahin pilaya.] Kya tum nahin jaante ke agar tum use pilate, tum use mere paas pate? Ae Aadam ki aulaad! Main beemar hua tum ne meri iyadat nahin ki. Woh kehta hai: Ae mere Rabb! Main Teri iyadat kaise karun, halanke Tu Rabbul Aalameen hai? Woh farmata hai: Kya tum nahin jaante ke mera falan banda beemar tha; agar tum uski iyadat karte, tum use mere paas pate? Ya tum Mujhe uske paas pate?"""
"403","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Beemar ki iyadat karo aur janaze ke peeche chalo; woh tumhein aakhirat yaad dilate hain."""
"404","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Teen baatein, sab har musalman par haq hain: beemar ki iyadat, janaze mein haziri, aur chheenkne wale ko jawab jab woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ki hamd kare."""
"405","[AI-translation] Bani Saad mein se teen [shakhs] se sab apne walid se bayan karte hain: ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Makkah mein Saad ki iyadat ko dakhil hue; Saad roye. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhein kya rula raha hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Mujhe dar hai ke main us zameen mein marun jahan se main ne hijrat ki, jaise Saad [bin Khaulah] mare."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Saad ko shifa de"" [teen baar]. Unhon ne kaha: ""Mere paas bahut maal hai; meri beti meri waris hai. Kya main apne sare maal ki wasiyat karun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Do tihaayi?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Nisf?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tihaayi?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tihaayi; aur tihaayi bahut hai. Be-shak tumhara apne maal se sadqa sadqa hai; tumhara apne ehl-o-ayal par kharch sadqa hai; jo tumhari biwi tumhare khane mein se khaye tumhare liye sadqa hai. Be-shak tum apne ghar walon ko khair mein chhodo ya Aap ne farmaya: kifayat mein tum unhein logon se mangte hue chhodo is se bahtar hai."" Aap ne apne hath se kaha."
"406","[AI-translation] Abu Asma se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jo apne bhai ki iyadat kare, woh jannat ke khurfah mein hai."" Main ne Abu Qilabah se kaha: ""Jannat ka khurfah kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Uske chune hue phal."" Main ne Abu Qilabah se kaha: ""Abu Asma ne use kis se bayan kiya?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Sauban se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se."""
"407","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Hazm aur Muhammad bin al-Munkadir samet masjid walon mein se chand logon se jo Umar bin al-Hakam bin Rafe Ansari ki iyadat ko aaye. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Hafs! Hamein bayan karo."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se suna unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo beemar ki iyadat kare, woh rehmat mein doobta hai; jab baithe, us mein thehar jata hai."""
"408","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Umar bin Safwan ne meri iyadat ki; namaz hazir hui, phir Ibn Umar ne unhein do rakat parhayein aur kaha: Hum musafir hain."""
"409","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke Yahudiyon ka ek khadim Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat karta tha phir beemar hua; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) uski iyadat ko tashreef laye, uske sirhane baithe. Aap ne farmaya: ""Islam lao."" Bachche ne apne walid ko dekha aur woh uske sirhane tha us ne use kaha: ""Aba al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki itaat karo."" Woh Islam laya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar nikle aur farma rahe the: ""Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne use aag se nijat di."""
"410","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madina tashreef laye, Abu Bakr aur Bilal bukhar mein mubtela hue. Unhon ne kaha: Main un donon ke paas dakhil hui. Main ne kaha: ""Ae mere abba! Tumhara kya haal hai? Ae Bilal! Tumhara kya haal hai?"" Unhon ne kaha: Jab Abu Bakr ko bukhar lagta, woh kehte: [sheir:] Har shakhs subah apne ghar walon mein hota hai... jabke maut uske joote ke tasme se zyada qareeb hai. Jab Bilal theek hote, woh apni aawaz buland karte aur kehte: [sheir:] Kaash, kya main raat guzarunga... waadi mein mere ird-gird izkhir aur jaleel hon; kya main ek din Majannah ke paniyon par aaunga... aur kya mujhe Shamah aur Tafil dikhenge. Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap ko khabar di. Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Madina ko hum mein mehbub bana jaise hum Makkah se muhabbat karte hain ya zyada; use sehatmand bana; hamare saa aur mudd mein barkat de; uska bukhar muntaqil kar aur use Juhfah mein kar de."""
"411","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Amr bin Saeed se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj Ibn Umar ke paas dakhil hua aur main unke paas tha phir kaha: ""Uska kya haal hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Achha."" Us ne poocha: ""Tumhein kis ne zakhmi kiya?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Mujhe us ne zakhmi kiya jo us din hathiyar uthane ka hukm deta hai jis mein uthana halal nahin."" Yani Hajjaj."
"412","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi al-Hudhail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Masud beemar ki iyadat ko dakhil hue unke sath chand qaum thi, aur ghar mein aurat thi phir qaum mein se ek shakhs aurat ko dekhne laga. Abdullah ne use kaha: ""Agar tumhari aankh phoot jaye, woh tumhare liye bahtar tha."""
"413","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Meri aankh dukhne lagi, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne meri iyadat ki..."
"414","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Jab Main use uske do mehbubon se aazmaun yani uski donon aankhein phir woh sabr kare, Main use jannat se badal dunga."""
"415","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Allah farmata hai: Ae Aadam ki aulaad! Main ne teri do izzatein leen. Tum ne sadme par sabr kiya aur ajr ki umeed rakhi, Main ne tumhare liye jannat ke siwa sawab raazi nahin kiya."""
"416","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) beemar ki iyadat karte, Aap uske sirhane baithe, phir farmate [saat baar]: ""Main Allah Azeem se, Arsh Azeem ke Rabb se mangta hun, ke woh tumhein shifa de."" Agar uski ajal mein takheer ho, woh apni takleef se aafiyat paye."
"417","[AI-translation] Rabi bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Hasan ke sath Qatadah ki iyadat ko gaya. Woh uske sirhane baithe, use poocha, phir uske liye dua ki. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Uske dil ko shifa de, aur uski beemari ko shifa de."""
"418","[AI-translation] Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghar walon mein kya karte the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Aap apne ghar walon ki madad karte the; jab namaz ka waqt aata, Aap bahar nikalte."""
"419","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya karte the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Aap apni jooti ganthe, aur woh karte jo mard apne ghar mein karta hai"" [doosri riwayat mein unhon ne kaha: ""Jo tum mein se ek apne ghar mein karta hai: jooti ganthe, kapda sile, aur silayi kare""]."
"420","[AI-translation] Amrah se riwayat hai: Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se poocha gaya: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya karte the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Aap aam insan the: apne kapde saaf karte aur apni bakri ka doodh dohte."""
"421","[AI-translation] Habib bin Ubaid se, Miqdam bin Madikarib se aur woh use pa chuke the unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se muhabbat kare, toh use bataye ke woh use mehbub rakhta hai."""
"422","[AI-translation] Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs mujh se mila, mere kandhe ko peeche se pakda. Unhon ne kaha: ""Jaan lo, main tumhein mehbub rakhta hun."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Allah tumhein mehbub rakhe jiske liye tum ne mujhe mehbub rakha."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Agar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne na farmaya hota: Jab shakhs kisi se muhabbat kare, toh use bataye ke woh use mehbub rakhta hai, main tumhein na batata."" Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh mujhe rishta pesh karne lage. Unhon ne kaha: ""Jaan lo, hamare paas baandi hai; jaan lo, woh kana hai."""
"423","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Koi do ek doosre se muhabbat nahin karte, magar un donon mein se afzal woh hai jo apne sathi se zyada muhabbat karta hai."""
"424","[AI-translation] Muadh bin Jabal se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Jab tum bhai se muhabbat karo, na us se behas karo, na uska mazaq udao, aur na uske bare mein poocho; ho sakta hai tum uske dushman ko pao phir woh tumhein woh bataye jo us mein nahin, toh tumhare aur uske darmiyan judayi kare."""
"425","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhein Siffeen mein kehte hue suna gaya: ""Be-shak aql dil mein hai, rehmat jigar mein hai, narmi tilli mein hai, aur jaan phephde mein hai."""
"426","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas baithe the, phir dehat ka ek shakhs sijan jubba pehne aaya, yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sir par khada hua aur bola: ""Be-shak tumhare sathi ne har sawar ko gira diya hai ya unhon ne kaha: har sawar ko girana chahta hai aur har charwahe ko uthana chahta hai!"" Nabi ne uske jubbe ke kinare pakde. Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya main tum par na-samajh ka libas nahin dekhta."" Phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ke Nabi Nuh (alaihis salam) jab unki wafat aayi, unhon ne apne bete se kaha: Main tumhein wasiyat sunata hun: main tumhein do baton ka hukm deta hun aur do se mana karta hun: main tumhein La ilaha illallah ka hukm deta hun; be-shak saat aasman aur saat zameen, agar ek palde mein rakhe jayein aur La ilaha illallah ek palde mein rakha jaye toh woh un par ghalib aayega; aur agar saat aasman aur saat zameen dhundli halqa hon toh La ilaha illallah use kaat dega; aur Subhanallah wa bihamdih be-shak woh har cheez ki namaz hai, aur us se har cheez ko rizq diya jata hai. Main tumhein mana karta hun: shirk, aur takabbur se. Main ne kaha ya kaha gaya: Ya Rasoolullah! Yeh shirk hum jaan chuke toh takabbur kya hai? Kya hum mein se ek ke paas hulla ho jise woh pehenta ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Kya hum mein se ek ke paas do achhi jootiyan hon, unke achhe tasmay hon? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Kya hum mein se ek ke paas sawari ho jis par woh sawar ho? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Kya hum mein se ek ke paas sathi hon jo uske paas baithein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Phir takabbur kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haq ko halka samajhna, aur logon ko haqeer samajhna."""
"427","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo apne nafs mein bada bane, ya apni chaal mein itraye, woh Allah Azza wa Jalla se milega jab Woh us par ghadabnak hoga."""
"428","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Woh mutakabbir nahin jis ke sath uska khadim khaye, aur bazaron mein gadhe par sawar ho, aur bakri ko bandh kar uska doodh dohe."""
"429","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri aur Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Izzat Uska tehband hai, aur takabbur Uska oopar ka kapda hai; jo Mujh se un mein se kisi mein jhagde, Main use azab dunga."""
"430","[AI-translation] Haisam bin Malik Tayi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Noman bin Bashir ko mimbar par kehte hue suna: ""Be-shak shaitan ke phande aur jaal hain; shaitan ke phande aur jaal hain: Allah ki nematon mein had se badhna, Allah ke atiye par fakhr, Allah ke bandon par takabbur, aur khwahish ki pairwi Allah ke siwa mein."""
"431","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jannat aur aag ne hujjat ki Sufyan ne bhi kaha: jannat aur aag ne jhagda kiya aag ne kaha: Mujh mein jabbar dakhil honge, mujh mein mutakabbir dakhil honge. Aur jannat ne kaha: Mujh mein kamzor dakhil honge, mujh mein faqeer dakhil honge. Allah Tabaraka wa Taala ne jannat se farmaya: Tum meri rehmat ho Main tum se jis par chahun reham karunga. Phir aag se kaha: Tum mera azab ho Main tum se jis par chahun azab dunga, aur tum donon mein se har ek bhari hui hai."""
"432","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba sakht aur murda-numa na the; woh apni majlison mein sheir sunate the, aur apni jahiliyat ke muamle ka zikr karte the; jab un mein se ek se Allah ke muamle mein se kisi ka irada kiya jata, uski aankhon ki putliyan ghoom jatin goya woh majnoon ho."""
"433","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya woh khubsurat tha phir bola: ""Mujhe khubsurti mehbub ki gayi, aur mujhe diya gaya jo tum dekhte ho! Yahan tak ke main nahin chahta ke koi mujh par fauqiyat rakhe"" ya unhon ne kaha: ""joote ke tasme mein."" Ya unhon ne kaha: ""surkh tasme mein. Kya woh takabbur hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin; lekin takabbur haq ko radd karna hai, aur logon ko haqeer samajhna hai."""
"434","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shuayb se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Mutakabbireen qiyamat ke din chhoti cheentiyon ki tarah mardon ki soorat mein jama kiye jayenge; unhein har jagah se zillat dhanp legi; unhein jahannum ki qaid ki taraf hankaya jayega jise Bolas kaha jata hai; un par bhadakti aag chha jayegi; unhein dozakhiyon ke peep se pilaya jayega: teenat-ul-khabal [peep]."""
"435","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: ""Lo [apna haq], apna difa karo."""
"436","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwiyon ne Fatima ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bheja; unhon ne ijazat mangi jab Nabi Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ke sath unki mirt mein the. Aap ne unhein ijazat di, woh dakhil huin. Unhon ne kaha: Aapki biwiyon ne mujhe bheja, woh Abu Quhafa ki beti ke bare mein adl mangti hain. Aap ne farmaya: Ae meri beti! Kya tum woh mehbub rakhti ho jo main mehbub rakhta hun? Unhon ne jawab diya: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Use mehbub rakho [Ayesha ko]. Woh khadi huin, bahar gayein, aur unhein bataya. Unhon ne kaha: Tum ne hamare liye kuchh nafa nahin diya; unke paas wapas jao. Unhon ne jawab diya: Allah ki qasam, main un se uske bare mein kabhi baat nahin karungi. Unhon ne Zainab ko bheja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zawja unhon ne ijazat mangi, Aap ne unhein ijazat di. Unhon ne Aap se woh kaha, aur Zainab par hamla kiya jo mujhe bura keh rahi thi; main dekhti rahi: kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe ijazat dete hain. Main rahi yahan tak ke main ne jana Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere apna difa karne ko bura nahin samajhte; main ne Zainab par hamla kiya, der na lagi main ne use ghalbe se zakhmi kar diya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye, phir farmaya: Be-shak woh Abu Bakr ki beti hai."""
"437","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Ansar ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: ""Hamare aur hamare bhaiyon ke darmiyan khajoor taqseem karo."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nahin."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum hamein kharch se kifayat karo, hum tumhein phal mein shareek karein?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Hum ne suna aur itaat ki."""
"438","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne qahet ke saal kaha woh sakht kathin saal tha, Umar ke dehatiyon ki oont, gehun, aur tel se tamam dehaton se madad mein koshish ke baad, yahan tak ke dehat khatam ho gaye us koshish se Umar khade hue dua karte hue aur kaha: ""Ae Allah! Unka rizq pahaad ki chotiyon par kar de."" Allah ne unke liye aur musalmanon ke liye qabool kiya. Jab us par baarish nazil hui, unhon ne kaha: ""Alhamdulillah; Allah ki qasam, agar Allah use kushaada na karta, main musalmanon ke kisi kushaada ghar walon ko na chhodta magar unke sath faqiron ki tadaad dakhil karta; do khane se halak nahin hote jo ek ko qayam rakhta hai."""
"439","[AI-translation] Salamah bin al-Akwa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhari qurbaniyan: tum mein se koi teesri [raat] ke baad subah na kare, jabke uske ghar mein us mein se kuchh ho."" Agle saal, unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kya hum karein jaise pichhle saal kiya?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Khao aur zakheera karo; woh saal woh mushaqqat mein the, main ne chaha ke tum madad karo."""
"440","[AI-translation] Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Muawiya ke paas baitha tha; unhon ne apne nafs se baat ki, phir hoshiyar hue, aur kaha: ""Tajurbe ke baghair hilm nahin"" use teen baar dohrate hue."
"441","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Auf se [ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)] ne farmaya: ""Main ne apne chachaon ke sath Mutayyabeen ki qasam dekhi; mujhe use todna pasand nahin, agarche mere liye surkh oont hon."""
"442","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ibn Masud aur Zubair ke darmiyan bhai-chara karaya."""
"443","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish aur Ansar ke darmiyan mere ghar mein jo Madina mein hai muahida karaya."""
"444","[AI-translation] Amr bin Shuayb se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath [Makkah] ke saal Kaaba ki seedhi par baithe; Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur sana ki, phir farmaya: ""Jiski jahiliyat mein keena ho, Islam use sakhti ke siwa nahin badhata; Fath [Makkah] ke baad hijrat nahin."""
"445","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baarish mein bheeg gaye; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne kapde us se hataye yahan tak ke baarish use lagi. Hum ne poocha: ""Aap ne aisa kyun kiya?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kyunke woh apne Rabb se abhi aayi hai."""
"446","[AI-translation] Humaid bin Malik bin Khusaim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Hurairah ke sath unki zameen mein Aqiq mein baitha tha; Madina walon ka ek giroh sawariyon par aaye aur utre. Humaid ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne kaha: ""Meri maa ke paas jao aur un se kaho: Tumhara beta tumhein salam kehta hai aur kehta hai: Hamein kuchh khilao."" Unki walida ne jau ki teen rotiyan, thoda tel aur namak thaali mein rakhe; unhon ne use mere sir par rakha; main use unke paas laya. Jab main ne use unke samne rakha, Abu Hurairah ne takbeer kahi aur kaha: ""Alhamdulillah jis ne hamein roti se ser kiya jab hamara khana do kaalon: khajoor aur pani ke siwa na tha."" Qaum ne khane mein se kuchh na khaya! Jab woh chale gaye, unhon ne kaha: ""Ae mere bhatije! Apni bakriyon se husn-e-sulook karo; un se mitti ponchho; unka baada achha karo; unki taraf namaz parho; be-shak woh jannat ke janwaron mein se hain. Qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, qareeb hai ke logon par zamana aaye: bakriyon ka chhota giroh uske malik ko Marwan ke ghar se zyada mehbub hoga."""
"447","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kufr ki jad mashriq ki taraf hai; fakhr aur takabbur ghode aur oont walon mein hai Alfaddadeen, oon [wale]; sukoon bakri walon mein hai."""
"448","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Mujhe kutte aur bakri par tajjub hai: bakri mein se saal mein itni aur itni zibah ki jati hai, aur itni aur itni hadiya ki jati hai, lekin bakri us se zyada hai! Kutiya ek kutiya itne aur itne [zyada] janti hai."""
"449","[AI-translation] Abu Zhabyan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Khattab ne mujh se kaha: ""Ae Abu Zhabyan! Tumhara atiya kitna hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Do hazaar paanch sau."" Unhon ne un se kaha: ""Ae Abu Zhabyan! Kheti aur maal se lo is se pehle ke Quraish ke ladke tum par ghalib aayein jo atiye ko maal nahin ginte."""
"450","[AI-translation] Abdah bin Hazn se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Oont wale aur bakri wale fakhr karne lage; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Musa bheje gaye jab woh bakri charate the; Dawood bheje gaye jab woh charate the; main bhi bheja gaya jab main Ajyad mein apne ghar walon ki bakriyan charata tha."""
"451","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Kabira gunah saat hain: pehle Allah ke sath shirk, jaan ka qatl, pak-daman auraton par tohmat, aur hijrat ke baad dehat ki taraf wapsi."""
"452","[AI-translation] Sauban se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: ""Dehat mein mat raho; be-shak dehat mein rehne wala qabron mein rehne wale jaisa hai."" Ahmad ne kaha: al-Kufur gaon hain."
"453","[AI-translation] Shuraih se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha se dehat ke bare mein poocha. Main ne kaha: ""Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dehat jate the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan. Aap in chhoti pahadiyon ki taraf jate the."""
"454","[AI-translation] Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs faut hua aur us ne apna beta aur apna aazad-karda chhoda; us ne apne bete ke bare mein apne aazad-karda ko wasiyat ki; aazad-karda ne kotahi nahin ki yahan tak ke bachcha baligh hua aur us ne uska nikah karaya. Bachche ne use kaha: ""Mujhe ilm talash karne ke liye tayyar karo."" Us ne use tayyar kiya; woh ek aalim ke paas aaya aur us se poocha. Aalim ne kaha: ""Jab tum jana chaho, mujh se kaho: mujhe sikhao."" Us ne kaha: ""Mere nikalne ka waqt hazir hua, mujhe sikhao."" Aalim ne kaha: ""Allah se daro, sabr karo, jald-baazi na karo."" Hasan ne kaha: Us mein sari khair hai bachcha aaya aur use bhoolta nahin; woh sirf teen hain. Jab woh apne ghar walon ke paas aaya, woh apni sawari se utra; jab ghar mein dakhil hua, toh ek mard soya hua aurat se door tha, aur uski biwi soyi hui thi! Us ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam, main iske sath kis ka intezar karun?"" Woh apni sawari par wapas gaya; jab talwar lene laga, use yaad aaya: ""Allah se daro, sabr karo jald-baazi na karo."" Woh wapas hua; jab uske sir par khada hua, us ne kaha: ""Main iske sath kisi cheez ka intezar nahin karta,"" phir apni sawari par wapas gaya; jab apni talwar lene laga, use yaad aaya aur uske paas wapas aaya. Jab uske sir par khada hua, mard jaag gaya; jab us ne use dekha, woh uski taraf lapka, use gale lagaya, bosa diya, aur us se poocha. Us ne kaha: ""Mere baad tumhein kya mila?"" Us ne jawab diya: ""Allah ki qasam, mujhe tumhare baad bahut khair mili; Allah ki qasam, mujhe tumhare baad mili: aaj raat main talwar aur tumhare sir ke darmiyan teen baar chala, phir jo ilm main ne paya us ne mujhe tumhare qatl se rok diya."""
"455","[AI-translation] Ashaj Abd al-Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak tum mein do akhlaq hain jinhein Allah mehbub rakhta hai."" Main ne poocha: ""Woh kya hain, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Hilm, aur haya."" Main ne poocha: ""Purane ya naye?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Purane."" Main ne kaha: ""Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne mujhe do akhlaq par paida kiya jinhein Allah mehbub rakhta hai."""
"456","[AI-translation] Qatadah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum se unhon ne bayan kiya jo wafd se mile jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Abd al-Qais mein se aaye aur Qatadah ne Abu Nadhrah ka zikr kiya Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ashaj Abd al-Qais se farmaya: ""Be-shak tum mein do sifatein hain jinhein Allah mehbub rakhta hai: hilm aur anaat."""
"457","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ashaj se Ashaj Abd al-Qais se farmaya: ""Be-shak tum mein do sifatein hain jinhein Allah mehbub rakhta hai: hilm aur anaat."""
"458","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Agar pahaad pahaad par zulm kare, toh zalim dhadham ho jaye."""
"459","[AI-translation] Fadhalah bin Ubaid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Teen shakhs jin ke bare mein nahin poocha jata: ek shakhs jo jamaat se juda hua, apne imam ki nafarmani ki, phir nafarman mara gaya toh uske bare mein na poocho; baandi ya ghulam jo apne aaqa se bhaag jaye, aur aurat jis ka shohar ghaib ho, aur uski duniya ki kifayat ki gayi phir woh ban-sanwar kar uske baad nikle. Aur teen jin ke bare mein nahin poocha jata: ek shakhs jo Allah ki chadar mein jhagda kare; be-shak Uski chadar takabbur hai, aur Uska tehband izzat hai. Aur ek shakhs jo Allah ke muamle mein shak kare, aur Allah ki rehmat se mayusi."""
"460","[AI-translation] Bakkar bin Abd al-Aziz se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada [Abu Bakrah] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Har gunah, Allah us mein se jo chahe qiyamat ke din tak multawi karta hai, siwa baghawat, walidain ki nafarmani, ya rishta todne ke: uske karne wale ke liye duniya mein maut se pehle jald karta hai."""
"461","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Tum mein se ek apne bhai ki aankh mein tinkah dekhta hai, lekin apni aankh mein shahteer ya lakdi bhool jata hai."" Abu Ubaid ne kaha: ""al-Jadl"" : oonchi badi lakdi hai."
"462","[AI-translation] Muawiya bin Qurrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Maqil Muzani ke sath tha; us ne raaste se takleef hatayi; main ne kuchh dekha phir us par sabqat ki. Unhon ne poocha: ""Tumhein us par kis ne ubhara jo tum ne kiya, ae mere bhatije?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Main ne tumhein kuchh karte dekha phir main ne kiya."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Achha kiya, ae mere bhatije! Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jo musalmanon ke raaste se takleef hataye, uske liye neki likhi jati hai; jiski neki qabool ki gayi, woh jannat mein dakhil hoga."""
"463","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ek doosre ko tohfa do, ek doosre se muhabbat karoge."""
"464","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ae mere bete! Tum aapas mein tabadla karo; be-shak woh tumhare darmiyan muhabbat badhata hai."""
"465","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bani Fazarah mein se ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko oontni hadiya di; Aap ne use badla diya, lekin woh na-khush hua. Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmate hue suna: ""Un mein se ek mujhe hadiya deta hai, main use apne paas ke qadr badla deta hun, phir woh na-khush hota hai. Allah ki qasam! Main apne is saal ke baad Arab mein se tohfa qabool nahin karunga siwa Quraishi, ya Ansari, ya Saqafi, ya Dausi ke."""
"466","[AI-translation] Ibn Masud, Uqbah ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo logon ne nabuwwat ke kalam [pehle] mein se paya: jab tum haya na karo toh jo chaho karo."""
"467","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Iman saath ke qareeb ya sattar ke qareeb shaakh hai; sab se afzal: La ilaha illallah; sab se adna: raaste se takleef hatana; aur haya iman ki shaakh hai."""
"468","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) parda-nasheen kunwari se zyada haya wale the; jab Aap [kuchh] na-pasand karte, hum Aapke chehre se jaan lete."""
"469","[AI-translation] Usman aur Ayesha se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi jab Aap Ayesha ke bistar par lete hue the, Ayesha ki mirt pehne hue Aap ne Abu Bakr ko usi haal mein ijazat di; unhon ne apni hajat poori ki, phir chale gaye. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat mangi; Aap ne unhein usi haal mein ijazat di; unhon ne apni hajat poori ki, phir chale gaye. Usman ne kaha: Phir main ne Aap se ijazat mangi; Aap baithe aur Ayesha se kaha: ""Apne kapde apne paas jama karo."" Main ne apni hajat poori ki phir chala gaya. Unhon ne kaha: Ayesha ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Main ne Aapko Abu Bakr aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke liye jald-baazi karte nahin dekha jaise Aap ne Usman ke liye jald-baazi ki?"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Usman haya wala mard hai; mujhe dar tha ke agar main ne use us haal mein ijazat di woh mujh tak apni hajat nahin pahunchayega."""
"470","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Haya kisi cheez mein nahin hoti magar use khubsurat karti hai; aur fahash kisi cheez mein nahin hota magar use bura karta hai."""
"471","[AI-translation] Salim se, unke walid se: ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo apne bhai ko haya ke bare mein nasihat [doosri riwayat mein: daant] raha tha [yahan tak ke goya kehta: us ne tumhein nuqsan pahunchaya]; Aap ne farmaya: ""Use chhod do; be-shak haya iman mein se hai."""
"472","[AI-translation] Ayesha se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar mein lete hue the, apni raan ya donon pindliyan khole hue; Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat mangi, Aap ne unhein usi tarah ijazat di, phir baat ki. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat mangi, Aap ne unhein usi tarah ijazat di, phir baat ki. Phir Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne ijazat mangi; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe aur apne kapde durust kiye Muhammad ne kaha: main ek din mein nahin kehta woh dakhil hue, phir baat ki. Jab bahar nikle, Ayesha ne kaha: Main ne poocha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Abu Bakr dakhil hue lekin Aap khush na hue aur unki parwah na ki, phir Umar dakhil hue lekin Aap khush na hue aur unki parwah na ki, phir Usman dakhil hue phir Aap baithe aur apne kapde durust kiye?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya main us mard se haya na karun jis se farishte haya karte hain?"""
"473","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak kareem kareem ka beta kareem ka beta kareem hai: Yusuf bin Yaqub bin Ishaq bin Ibrahim, Rahman Tabaraka wa Taala ke Khaleel."" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar main qaid mein utna rehta jitna Yusuf rahe, phir mere paas bulane wala aata toh main jawab deta; jab qasid uske paas aaya aur bola: {Apne Rabb ke paas wapas jao aur us se poocho: un auraton ka kya haal hai jinhon ne apne hath kaate} [Yusuf: 50]. Aur Allah ki rehmat Lut par; be-shak woh mazboot sahare ki panah lete the, jab unhon ne apni qaum se kaha: {Kaash mujhe tum par quwwat hoti ya main mazboot sahare ki panah leta} [Hud: 80]. Allah ne unke baad koi Nabi nahin bheja magar apni qaum ki quwwat mein."" Muhammad bin Umar is hadees ke rawi ne kaha: as-Sarwah: kasrat aur quwwat hai."
"474","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rabi Jumua ke din Alqamah ke paas jate the; agar main wahan na hota, woh unhein bhejte, phir ek baar aaye aur main wahan na tha; Alqamah mujh se mile aur mujh se kaha: ""Kya tum ne nahin dekha Rabi kya laya?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum nahin dekhte log kitni dua karte hain, aur unki kitni kam qabool hoti hai? Woh is liye ke Allah Azza wa Jalla khalis ke siwa dua qabool nahin karta."" Main ne kaha: ""Kya Abdullah ne woh nahin kaha?"" Unhon ne poocha: ""Unhon ne kya kaha?"" Unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne kaha: ""Allah sunane wale, dikhane wale, aur khelne wale se nahin sunta; siwa dua karne wale ke jo dil se pukhta dua kare."" Unhon ne kaha: Phir Alqamah ne use zikr kiya? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan."""
"475","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi dua kare, toh na kahe: Agar Tu chahe; use sawal pukhta karna chahiye aur raghbat badi karni chahiye; be-shak Allah par woh bada nahin jo Us ne diya."""
"476","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi dua kare, toh use dua mein pukhta rehna chahiye; na kahe [doosri riwayat mein: jab tum Allah se dua karo, dua mein pukhta raho aur tum mein se koi na kahe]: Ae Allah, agar Tu chahe toh mujhe de; be-shak Allah par koi majboor karne wala nahin."""
"477","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se unhon ne dawa kiya un se suna ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dua karte dekha apne donon hath uthaye hue kehte hue: ""[Ae Allah] be-shak main bashar hun; Mujhe azaab na de, momineen mein se jis mard ko main ne takleef di ya bura kaha us mein Mujhe azaab na de."""
"478","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Tufail bin Amr Dausi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Be-shak Daus ne nafarmani ki aur inkar kiya; un par Allah se bad-dua karein!"" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qibla ki taraf mutawajjuh hue aur apne donon hath uthaye logon ne samjha Aap un par bad-dua kar rahe hain phir farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Daus ko hidayat de, aur unhein le aa."""
"479","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek saal baarish qahet hui; baaz musalman Jumua ke din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf khade hue aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Baarish qahet hui, zameen banjar hui, maal halak hua."" Aap ne apne donon hath uthaye aasman mein badal nazar nahin aata tha, Aap ne apne donon hath phailaye yahan tak ke main ne Aapki baghalon ki safaidi dekhi, Allah se baarish mangte hue. Hum ne Jumua nahin parha yahan tak ke qareeb ghar wale jawan ko apne ghar walon ke paas wapas jane ki fikr hui! Woh Jumua raha, phir agle Jumua jab aaya. Toh unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Ghar gir gaye, qafile ruk gaye!"" Aap Aadam ke bete ki jald uktahat par muskuraye, aur apne hath se kaha: ""Ae Allah! Hamare ird-gird, hum par nahin."" Madina se badal chhat gaya."
"480","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) panah mangte the, kehte hue: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main susti se teri panah mangta hun, aur buzdili se teri panah mangta hun, aur budhape se teri panah mangta hun, aur bukhl se teri panah mangta hun."""
"481","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Main apne bande ke gumaan ke paas hun; main uske sath hun jab woh Mujhe pukare."""
"482","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye majlis mein ginte the: ""Rabbighfirli wa tub alayya, innaka Antat Tawwabur Rahim [Ae mere Rabb! Mujhe bakhsh de aur meri tauba qabool kar; be-shak Tu Tauba Qabool karne wala Raheem hai]"" sau baar."
"483","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Duha parhi, phir farmaya: ""Allahummaghfirli wa tub alayya, innaka Antat Tawwabur Rahim [Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de aur meri tauba qabool kar; be-shak Tu Tauba Qabool karne wala Raheem hai]"" yahan tak ke use sau baar kaha."
"484","[AI-translation] Shaddad bin Aus ne mujhe bayan kiya, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sayyidul istighfar yeh hai ke woh kahe: Allahumma Anta Rabbi, la ilaha illa Anta, khalaqtani wa ana abduka, wa ana ala ahdika wa wadika mastataatu, auzu bika min sharri ma sanaatu, abuu laka biniamatika, wa abuu laka bidhanbi, faghfirli; fa innahu la yaghfirudh dhunuba illa Anta [Ae Allah! Tu mera Rabb hai, Tere siwa koi mabood nahin; Tu ne mujhe paida kiya aur main Tera banda hun; main Tere ahd aur wade par hun jitna ho sake; main Teri panah mangta hun us shar se jo main ne kiya; main Teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun; main apne gunah ka iqrar karta hun; mujhe bakhsh de be-shak gunah Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta]."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo use din mein yaqeen samet kahe, phir us din shaam se pehle mar jaye toh woh jannatiyon mein se hai; jo use raat mein yaqeen samet kahe, phir subah se pehle mar jaye toh woh jannatiyon mein se hai."""
"485","[AI-translation] Abu Burdah se riwayat hai: Main ne Agharr ko jo Juhainah mein se ek mard hai Abdullah bin Umar ko bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah se tauba karo; be-shak main Us se har din sau baar tauba karta hun."""
"486","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Ujrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Muaqqibat jo unhein kehne wala nakam nahin hota: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar sau baar."" Ibn Abi Unaisah aur Amr bin Qais ne use marfu kiya."
"487","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: ""Be-shak Allah ke liye bhai ki dua qabool hoti hai."""
"488","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Abdullah bin Safwan se aur unke nikah mein Darda bint Abi Darda theen unhon ne kaha: Main unke paas Shaam aaya; main ne Umm Darda ko ghar mein paya, Abu Darda ko nahin paya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum is saal Hajj ka irada rakhte ho?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Hamare liye khair ki dua karo; be-shak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: Be-shak musalman shakhs ki dua uske bhai ke liye peeth peeche qabool hoti hai, uske sir par muakkal farishta hai, jab woh apne bhai ke liye khair ki dua karta hai, kehta hai: Ameen, aur tumhare liye us jaisa. Unhon ne kaha: Main bazaar mein Abu Darda se mila, unhon ne us jaisa kaha, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se naqal karte hue."
"489","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe aur Muhammad ko bakhsh de hum donon ko!"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum ne use bahut logon se tang kar diya."""
"490","[AI-translation] Umar se riwayat hai ke unki dua mein se tha: ""Ae Allah! Mujhe abraar ke sath wafat de, mujhe ashraar mein na chhod, aur mujhe akhyaar se mila."""
"491","[AI-translation] Shaqiq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah [Ibn Masud], in duaon se bahut dua karte the: ""Ae hamare Rabb! Hamare darmiyan sulah kara, hamein Islam ke raaston ki hidayat de, hamein andheron se noor ki taraf nijat de, hum se fawahish ko pher de jo zahir aur jo chhupi, hamare kaanon aur aankhon aur dilon aur biwiyon aur auladon mein barkat de, hum par tauba qabool kar be-shak Tu Tauba Qabool karne wala Raheem hai, hamein apni nemat ka shukr karne wala bana, uski sana karne wala, use kehne wala, aur use hum par poora kar."""
"492","[AI-translation] Sabit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Anas apne bhai ke liye dua karte, kehte: ""Allah us par abraar qaum ki salat kare, jo zalim ya fajir nahin hain, jo raat ko [namaz mein] khade hote hain, aur din mein roza rakhte hain."""
"493","[AI-translation] Amr bin Hurais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Meri walida mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas le gayein; Aap ne mere sir par hath phera aur mere liye rizq ki dua ki."""
"494","[AI-translation] Abdullah Rumi se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: ""Tumhare bhai Basra se tumhare paas aaye"" aur woh us din [Zawiyah] mein the ""taake tum unke liye Allah se dua karo."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah! Hamein bakhsh de aur hum par reham kar, hamein duniya mein hasana de, aur aakhirat mein hasana, aur hamein aag ke azab se bacha."" Unhon ne izafa manga, Unhon ne us jaisa kaha, Unhon ne kaha: ""Agar tumhein yeh diya gaya, toh tumhein duniya aur aakhirat ki khair di gayi."""
"495","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tehni li phir use jhatka, woh na jhadi, phir use jhatka woh na jhadi, phir use jhatka woh jhad gayi [patte]. Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, gunahon ko jhaad dete hain, jaise ped apne patte jhaadta hai."""
"496","[AI-translation] [Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha:] Ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kaun si dua afzal hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah se duniya aur aakhirat mein muafi aur aafiyat mango."" Agle din woh Aapke paas aaya. Bola: ""Ae Nabiullah! Kaun si dua afzal hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Duniya aur aakhirat mein muafi aur aafiyat mango; jab tumhein duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat di gayi, tum kamyab hue."""
"497","[AI-translation] Abu Dharr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ko sab se mehbub kalam: Subhanallah la sharika lah, lahul mulku wa lahul hamdu, wa Huwa ala kulli shai-in qadir. La haula wa la quwwata illa billah, Subhanallah wa bihamdih [Allah paak hai, uska koi shareek nahin; usi ki badshahat aur hamd hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Allah ke siwa koi taqat aur quwwat nahin; Allah paak hai aur uski hamd ke sath]."""
"498","[AI-translation] Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas dakhil hue jab main namaz parh rahi thi aur Aapko hajat thi, main ne Aap par der ki Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Ayesha! Tum par jamal dua, aur jawame lazim hain."" Jab main farigh hui, main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Jamal dua aur jawame kya hain?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kaho: Allahumma inni as-aluka minal khairi kullihi, ajilihi wa ajilihi, ma alimtu minhu wa ma lam aalam. Wa auzu bika minash sharri kullihi, ajilihi wa ajilihi, ma alimtu wa ma lam aalam. Wa as-alukal jannata wa ma qarraba ilaiha min qaulin au amal, wa auzu bika minan nari wa ma qarraba ilaiha min qaulin au amal, wa as-aluka mimma sa-alaka bihi Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), wa auzu bika mimma taawwadza minhu Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), wa ma qadhaita li min qadhain fajal aqibatahu rashada [Ae Allah! Main Tujh se sari khair mangta hun, uski jald aur der wali, jo main janta hun aur jo nahin janta. Main Tujh se sare shar se panah mangta hun uski jald aur der wali, jo main janta hun aur nahin janta. Main Tujh se jannat mangta hun aur jo use qareeb kare baat ya amal se; main Tujh se aag se panah mangta hun aur jo use qareeb kare baat ya amal se; main Tujh se woh mangta hun jo Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Tujh se manga, aur Tujh se us se panah mangta hun jis se Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne panah mangi; aur jo Tu mere liye faisla kare, uska anjaam hidayat bana]."""
"499","[AI-translation] Anas aur Malik bin Aus bin al-Hadsan se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qaza-e-hajat ke liye bahar nikle, Aapko koi pairwi karne wala na mila; Umar bahar nikle Aapke peeche lotay ya taharat ki jagah samet. Unhon ne Aapko gali mein sajda karte paya; woh hate aur Aapke peeche baithe, yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna sir uthaya, phir farmaya: ""Tum ne achha kiya, ae Umar, jab tum ne mujhe sajda karte paya phir mujh se hat gaye; be-shak Jibreel mere paas aaye aur kaha: Jo tum par ek baar salat bheje Allah us par das baar salat bhejta hai, aur uske das darje buland karta hai."""
